endpoint.response:
{ success: true, message: "OK", data: {
    applied: { date_from, date_to, company_id: int[], company_site_id: int[], operational_site_id: int[] },
    months: "YYYY-MM"[],                             (tutti i mesi dell'intervallo, in ordine)
    functions: FunctionTrendRow[],                   (per label; "structure" e poi "unattributed" in coda)
    totals: { revenue: number[], cost: number[], margin: number[],
              previous_year: { revenue: number[], cost: number[], margin: number[] } },   (stesse posizioni di months)
    by_nature: NatureTrendRow[]                      (direct, indirect, general, poi null)
} }
FunctionTrendRow = { key: string, label: string|null, revenue: number[], cost: number[], margin: number[] }
                   (key = id funzione | "structure" | "unattributed"; D-7)
NatureTrendRow = { nature: "direct"|"indirect"|"general"|null, cost: number[], share_of_revenue: (number|null)[] }
Importi imponibili, number a 2 decimali; quote percentuali a 1 decimale. Invarianti: per ogni mese la somma
di functions.revenue = totals.revenue, functions.cost = totals.cost (residuo di arrotondamento sull'ultima
quota), by_nature.cost = totals.cost; margin = revenue - cost ovunque.
